# Generated context index is covered by *.db above. Keep both runtime files
# untracked; an ignore rule cannot hide a file already in the Git index.
# The append-only access log is written on reads (not source).
.dunkingsheep/access.jsonl
.venv/
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/

# The desk's own secrets must never be published. Two commits on public PRs added
# data/ on 2026-10-29 (plaintext desk password, API token, cookie store and the
# owner's conversation; commit 52847e5 is still served by raw.githubusercontent -
# a force-push does not unpublish a SHA). t746 landed these rules and
# tools/check_public_secrets.py in CI; t756 adds the wider names and the LOCAL
# refusal, because CI runs after the commit is already public and an ignore rule
# cannot hide a file that is already in the index.
data/
auth.json
owner-credentials
*.sqlite3
# Credential-shaped files (t746 secret guard).
*-credentials
*.pem
*token*
# help goldens for the token commands are plain help text, not secrets (t1243)
!rust/crates/ds-cli/tests/help/*token*
.env
*.key

# Rust build artefacts (T00): the workspace is built by every task.
rust/target/
